
---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const lastUpdated = "21 November 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy information for visitors to Sanderson Knights."
>
  <article class="page prose">
    <h1 class="page__title">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p>
      Sanderson Knights is an independent visual curation of horology.
      We respect the privacy of visitors and aim to collect only
      the information necessary to operate and maintain this website.
    </p>

    <p>
      <em>Last updated: {lastUpdated}</em>
    </p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

    <p>
      Sanderson Knights does not currently offer visitor accounts,
      newsletters, or contact forms that require personal information.
    </p>

    <p>
      When you visit the website, technical information such as your
      IP address, browser details, and requested pages may be
      processed by our hosting provider for website delivery,
      security, and maintenance.
    </p>

    <h2>Hosting and Third-Party Services</h2>

    <p>
      This website is hosted on Cloudflare Pages, with photographs
      delivered through Cloudflare R2. Cloudflare may process
      technical information necessary to provide these services,
      including security and network request data.
    </p>

    <p>
      For more information about Cloudflare's data practices,
      please refer to its
      <a
        href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and Analytics</h2>

    <p>
      Sanderson Knights does not currently use advertising
      trackers or third-party marketing analytics.
      Essential website infrastructure may use cookies or
      similar technologies for security and service delivery.
    </p>

    <h2>External Links</h2>

    <p>
      Exhibitions may include links to photographers,
      manufacturers, publishers, or other external sources.
      These websites operate independently and are subject
      to their own privacy policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Retention and Security</h2>

    <p>
      Technical information processed by our service providers
      is handled according to their applicable retention and
      security practices. The website is delivered over HTTPS.
    </p>

    <h2>Your Privacy Rights</h2>

    <p>
      Depending on applicable law, you may have rights concerning
      your personal information, including requesting access,
      correction, or deletion.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>

    <p>
      This policy may be updated to reflect changes in the
      website, its services, or applicable requirements.
      The revision date will be updated accordingly.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
